Subject: [PATCH 02039/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for PHASE A2 (DEPTH;
 THE real OOD test; gated_on A1 family_split_feasible==true) -- CROSS-FAMILY
 transfer on the EXISTING pool. Using the recovered provenance manifest, train
 the set-encoder on a SUBSET of task-families and test the beats-vote gate on
 candidates from HELD-OUT families (NO family in both train and test) -- the
 real OOD test the within-pool .393 split did not run. Report
 cross_family_delta (set_encoder@1 - vote@1 on held-out families) + task-level
 bootstrap CI95 (>=2000 resamples) + held_out_family_n + held_out_task_n +
 within_minus_cross_gap (how much the win shrinks vs the within-pool +0.4423)
 + oracle@K positive control. Include a STATIC vs ONLINE-ADAPTED arm.
 GENERALIZES (cross_family_delta>0 AND CI95-excl-0) = a GENERAL selection
 signal (north-star-grade -> opens the DiffusionGemma gate). COLLAPSES =
 per-family-basin memorization (decision-grade -> scope the headline to
 within-pool). verifier_is_oracle=false.

